# Compiled objects. `R CMD build` installs the package to build the vignettes,
# which compiles in place under src/, and the tarball is written before the
# cleanup script removes them -- so without this they ship in the source
# package and CRAN notes them.
\.o$
\.so$
\.dll$
\.dylib$
^bench$
